  "geometry_notes": [
    "Nominal sharp intersections as drawn. No radius or chamfer dimension is labelled on the I-beam page; no small unlabelled corner is invented. Strand and web-hole details excluded from gross outline.",
    "Top-flange edge thickness is derived by subtracting the printed bottom-flange edge, lower haunch, straight web and 105 mm upper haunch from the printed depth; this is exact chain closure, not a scale measurement or property fit.",
    "The upper haunch horizontal run is the printed 105 mm in all three groups, equal to half the top-width minus web-width.",
    "The I18 bottom width is 660 mm, read independently from the scan; the lower-group I15-I17 base is 610 mm.",
    "All 11 areas match exactly; integer Yb/Yt round within 0.5 mm, Ixx within 0.085 percent and moduli within 0.05 percent. Source rounding and minor table inconsistency are retained. I13 printed Zt is 138.81 x 10^6 mm3 and I15 is 166.0 x 10^6 mm3.",
    "The SCIB M2-M10 page corroborates existing OKA M nominal outlines; those are not duplicated as nine new geometries.",
    "Gross concrete only. Strand-position and web-hole callouts are not outline dimensions. Undated source availability does not establish current physical production or approval for design."
  ],
